# Lotus new-chain patch series — applies to bitcoin-abc HEAD (see bitcoin-abc-version)
# NOTE: patches were written against eCash v0.24.11 and NEED REBASE
#       onto bitcoin-abc latest before they apply cleanly.
#       Run: make refresh SERIES=v2 COMMIT=<latest-bitcoin-abc>
# Each patch covers one logical topic; no file appears in two patches.
# Old mainnet patches archived in patches/archive/mainnet/.
#
# To build: cd daemon && make setup && make build
#
# Binary names, version strings, cmake packaging
