06-nng-interface.patch
# Log2 fixed-point math (Turner algorithm)
07-intmath-log2.patch
# Log2-based block reward issuance curve (OLD — superseded by 22+23)
08-issuance.patch
# New Lotus opcodes (OP_MULPOW2, OP_RAWLEFTBITSHIFT, etc.)
10-script-opcodes.patch
# Taproot implementation — REVIEW for new chain
11-taproot.patch
# Network identity: magic bytes, ports, primitives
12-chain-params.patch
# Assume-valid constants — PLACEHOLDER: contains v1 Lotus mainnet values; replace with new
# chain assume-valid block hash and chain work before launch. Also replace 12-chain-params.patch
